<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>NotifyNYC CAP RSS Feed</title><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/rss/rss.xml</link><description>Common Alerting Protocol formatted RSS feed</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:21:59 GMT</pubDate><lastBuildDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:21:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>Everbridge: www.everbridge.com</generator><item><title>Notify NYC - פארקער אפּהאלטן</title><description>דערווארט פארקער אפּהאלטן אין דער געגנט פון FDR Dr קארנער E 10 St אין Manhattan. ניצט אלטערנאטיווע וועגן און לאזט איבעריגע צייט אנצוקומען.</description><guid>2337151014565555</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:35 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Yiddish]</author><enclosure length="1465" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b7aa9fa954d0d2416.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b7aa9fa954d0d2416.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - ٹریفک میں تاخیر</title><description>Manhattan میں FDR Dr اور E 10 St کے علاقے میں ٹریفک میں تاخیر کی توقع رکھیں۔  متبادل راستے اختیار کریں اور سفر کے لیے اضافی وقت رکھیں۔</description><guid>2337151014565554</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:35 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Urdu]</author><enclosure length="1451" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b674a85b4b7423485.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b674a85b4b7423485.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Demoras por el tráfico</title><description>Habrá demoras por el tráfico el área de FDR Dr y E 10 St en Manhattan. Use rutas alternativas y tenga en cuenta que tendrá más tiempo de viaje.</description><guid>2337151014565553</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:35 GMT</pubDate><category>Infra</category><author>NYCEM [Spanish]</author><enclosure length="1369" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b7aa9fa954d0d2417.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b7aa9fa954d0d2417.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Задержки движения транспорта</title><description>Будьте готовы к задержкам в движении транспорта в районе FDR Dr и E 10 St в Manhattan. Рекомендуется воспользоваться другими маршрутами и выделить дополнительное время на поездку.</description><guid>2337151014565552</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:35 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Russian]</author><enclosure length="1570" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b16b8159767b189c9.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b16b8159767b189c9.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Opóźnienia w ruchu</title><description>Spodziewaj się opóżnień w ruchu drogowym na terenie FDR Dr i E 10 St w Manhattan. Wybierz trasę alternatywną i przygotuj się na przedłużenie czasu podróży.</description><guid>2337151014565551</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:35 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Polish]</author><enclosure length="1390" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b7aa9fa954d0d2418.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b7aa9fa954d0d2418.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC -교통체증</title><description>Manhattan의 FDR Dr 및 E 10 St 지역에서 교통정체를 예상하시기 바랍니다. 대체 경로를 이용하시고 도착지까지 추가의 시간을 예상하시기 바랍니다.</description><guid>2337151014565550</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:35 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Korean]</author><enclosure length="1404" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b16b8159767b189ca.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288b16b8159767b189ca.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC -  Rallentamenti della circolazione</title><description>Si prevedono rallentamenti della circolazione nella zona FDR Dr e E 10 St in Manhattan.  Considerare tragitti alternativi e prevedere tempi più lunghi per gli spostamenti.</description><guid>2337151014565549</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:30 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Italian]</author><enclosure length="1410" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d2886674a85b4b7423483.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d2886674a85b4b7423483.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Reta nan Trafik</title><description>Atann reta nan trafik nan zòn FDR Dr ak E 10 St nan Manhattan. Itilize lòt wout epi mete plis tan pou vwayaje.</description><guid>2337151014565548</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:30 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Haitian Creole]</author><enclosure length="1339" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d28867aa9fa954d0d2410.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d28867aa9fa954d0d2410.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Ralentissements de la circulation</title><description>Des ralentissements sont à prévoir dans le secteur de FDR Dr et E 10 St, dans le quartier de/du Manhattan. Envisagez d'autres itinéraires et prévoyez un temps de trajet plus long.</description><guid>2337151014565547</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:30 GMT</pubDate><category>Infra</category><author>NYCEM [French]</author><enclosure length="1413" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288616b8159767b189c5.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288616b8159767b189c5.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - 交通延誤</title><description>預期Manhattan 的 FDR Dr 和 E 10 St地區交通延誤。考慮其他路線或提前上路。</description><guid>2337151014565546</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:30 GMT</pubDate><category>Infra</category><author>NYCEM [Chinese]</author><enclosure length="1305" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d28867aa9fa954d0d2411.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d28867aa9fa954d0d2411.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - যানবাহন চলাচলে বিলম্ব</title><description>Manhattan-এ FDR Dr ও E 10 St-এর এলাকায় যানবাহন চলাচলে বিলম্ব হতে পারে। বিকল্প পথগুলো ব্যবহার করুন এবং ভ্রমণের জন্য বাড়তি সময় হাতে রাখুন।</description><guid>2337151014565545</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:30 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Bengali]</author><enclosure length="1584" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288616b8159767b189c4.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d288616b8159767b189c4.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - تأخير في حركة المرور</title><description>توقع  تأخيرً  في حركة السير في المنطقة الواقعة ما بين FDR Dr و E 10 St في Manhattan.  ينبغي استخدام طرق بديلة وإتاحة مزيد من الوقت للسفر.</description><guid>2337151014565544</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:10:30 GMT</pubDate><category>Transport</category><author>NYCEM [Arabic]</author><enclosure length="1465" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d2886674a85b4b7423482.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/698d2886674a85b4b7423482.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Traffic Delays - FDR Drive (MN)</title><description>Notification issued 02-11-2026 at 08:08 PM.



Due to a vehicle collision, expect extensive northbound traffic delays on the FDR Drive at East 10th Street in Manhattan. Consider alternate routes and allow for additional travel time.


